{"id":"e91996b4cded8a6b","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-L-generic-extension.md","title":"L Generic Extension","display":"thm-L-generic-extension — L Generic Extension","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-L-generic-extension","aliases":["58-thm-L-generic-extension","L Generic Extension","Forcing Over L"],"display":"thm-L-generic-extension — L Generic Extension","depends_on":["[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC]]","[[58-thm-generic-extension-properties]]","[[../batch08/58-thm-independence-CH.md]]","[[58-df-constructible-universe]]","[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-L-generic-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-L-generic-extension</span><span>L Generic Extension</span><span>Forcing Over L</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-L-generic-extension — L Generic Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"af41b848b759f6c6\" href=\"?note=af41b848b759f6c6\" title=\"58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC\">58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a2335a033d2b39a0\" href=\"?note=a2335a033d2b39a0\" title=\"58-thm-generic-extension-properties\">58-thm-generic-extension-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3ec71b553c025f0a\" href=\"?note=3ec71b553c025f0a\" title=\"../batch08/58-thm-independence-CH.md\">../batch08/58-thm-independence-CH.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"58-df-constructible-universe\">58-df-constructible-universe</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md\">../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}}L_\\alpha\">\\(L=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}}L_\\alpha\\)</span> 是依赖文件定义的可构造类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},G\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},G\\in V\\)</span>，固定当前偏序的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P^2\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P^2\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(G,\\mathbb P;L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(G,\\mathbb P;L)\\)</span> 保留原三元接口，省略的序关系明确为当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span>，不在同一次调用中重选。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\\)</span> 使用书内序显式接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{G,\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{G,\\mathbb P}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span> 来自名字求值及名字层级定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}=\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}=\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> 使用书内成员语言公理码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 是该语言的类满意关系；空赋值表示闭句求值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L[G]\">\\(L[G]\\)</span> 是下式的类外延，不是集合变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Generic}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(G,\\mathbb P;L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbb P\\in L\\land\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in L\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall D\\in L\\;(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to G\\cap D\\ne\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Generic}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(G,\\mathbb P;L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbb P\\in L\\land\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in L\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall D\\in L\\;(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to G\\cap D\\ne\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\\in V\\land G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\to\nL[G]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in V:\\exists\\sigma\\in L\\;(\\mathrm{Name}(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\\land x=\\operatorname{val}_{G,\\mathbb P}(\\sigma))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb P\\in V\\land G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\to\nL[G]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in V:\\exists\\sigma\\in L\\;(\\mathrm{Name}(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\\land x=\\operatorname{val}_{G,\\mathbb P}(\\sigma))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}L\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathbb P\\in L\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(G,\\mathbb P;L)\n\\to\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\;\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(L[G],\\varphi,\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}L\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathbb P\\in L\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(G,\\mathbb P;L)\n\\to\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\;\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(L[G],\\varphi,\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在前两节中给出泛型性、名字求值扩张及类满意关系；序关系必须属于 L。不再让 Remark 独自承担 L[G] 的定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC","status":"resolved","id":"af41b848b759f6c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC]]","embed":false},{"target":"5